{"sourceUrl":"https://gpabl.gzu.edu.cn/2026/0904/c18886a279112/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:57.797501+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gpabl.gzu.edu.cn/2026/0904/c18886a279112/page.htm","html":"<div><div><p><span>绿色农药全国重点实验室（精细化工研究开发中心）</span></p><p><span>接收2027届优秀应届本科毕业生复</span><span>试细则</span></p><p><a href=\"https://gpabl.gzu.edu.cn/2026/0904/c18886a279112/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>根据贵大发</span><span><span>[202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>]2</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>号《贵州大学关于推荐</span><span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生的通知》和研究生院有关文件精神，结合</span><span><span>绿色农药全国重点实验室的</span></span><span>实际情况，制定本工作实施细则。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、拟接收专业、人数</span></strong></p><p><span>  <span><span>1.</span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span>拟接收学术学位专业：</span></p><p><span><span><span>植物保护、化学、农药学、</span><span><span>应用化学</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>     2.拟接收专业学位专业：</span></p><p><span><span><span>资源利用与植物保护、</span><span><span>化学工程</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>  <span>3.</span></span><span>人数：</span><span>15</span><span>人</span></p><p><strong><span>二、报名条件</span></strong></p><p><span>普通高考全日制本科学生的贵州大学</span><span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span>届应届毕业生</span><span>(</span><span>含普通高考第一批次预科录取学生，不含独立学院学生</span><span>)</span><span>，并且满足下列条件：</span></p><p><span>  <span>1. </span></span><span>政治表现好，思想品德好，勤学上进，遵纪守法，无违法违纪行为。</span></p><p><span>  <span><span>2.</span><span></span></span></span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和学术不端行为。</span></p><p><span>        3. </span><span><span><span>申请者为国家普通本科招生计划录取的化学</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>化学、化学生物学、应用化学</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>、生物、植物保护、药学等相关专业应届本科毕业生，并获得推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span>  <span>4. </span></span><span>学习成绩优秀，在读期间修读课程按学分加权平均成绩在本专业排名前</span><span>30%(</span><span>以教务系统正考成绩计算</span><span>)</span><span>或符合所在学院推免资格。学术兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识和创新能力。</span><span>(</span><span>大北农创新班不受专业排名前</span><span>30%(</span><span>以教务系统正考成绩计算</span><span>)</span><span>限制</span><span>)</span></p><p><span>  <span>5.</span></span><span>英语通过国家四级</span><span>(</span><span>或四级考试成绩在</span><span>425</span><span>分以上</span><span>)</span><span>水平考试（或日语通过全国大学日语考试四级）；通过国家六级英语考试者综合评定时予以优先考虑。</span></p><p><span>  <span>6. </span></span><span>身体健康，体育成绩合格。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、申请及推荐工作程序</span></strong></p><p><span>  <span>1. </span></span><span>符合推免生条件的学生于</span><span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span><span><span>日前向</span><span><span>绿色农药全国重点实验室</span></span><span>提交《贵州大学推荐优秀本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生申请表》</span></span></span><span>(</span><span>一式三份</span><span>)</span><span>，并提供加盖本科所在学院公章的在校历年成绩证明，英语四级或六级合格证书或成绩单复印件</span><span>(</span><span>查看原件</span><span>)</span><span>，本人签名的推免诚信承诺书。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://gpabl.gzu.edu.cn/2026/0904/c18886a279112/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://gpabl.gzu.edu.cn/2026/0904/c18886a279112/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>  <span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>绿色农药全国重点实验室</span></span><span>推免生工作领导小组根据接收推免生人数和推免生本科期间总成绩确定拟接收推免生名单。</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://gpabl.gzu.edu.cn/2026/0904/c18886a279112/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>  <span>3. </span></span><span>材料递交截止时间：</span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>日</span><span><span><span>15</span></span><span>:00</span></span><span>前。</span></p><p><span>  <span>4.</span></span><span>东校区精化中心</span><span>A</span><span>栋</span><span>204</span><span>研究生办公室。</span></p><p><span>  <span>5. </span></span><span>为便于后期接收通知，申请人可加入备考</span><span>QQ</span><span>群</span><span>(493846163)</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、考核内容及程序</span></strong></p><p><span>         1. </span><span>考核形式</span></p><p><span>面试</span><span>(100</span><span>分</span><span>)</span><span>由学科带头人、研究生导师共同组成复试小组，对推免生进行综合面试，考核综合素质</span><span>(</span><span>包括人文综合素质测试、专业背景知识测试、科研能力测试等内容</span><span>)</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>         2. </span><span>评分原则和标准</span></p><p><span>面试成绩</span><span>(</span><span>百分制</span><span>)</span><span>＝所有面试教师成绩之和</span><span>/</span><span>面试教师人数</span></p><p><span>总成绩</span><span>(</span><span>百分制</span><span>)=</span><span>本科期间综合成绩</span><span>(</span><span>百分制</span><span>)× 40%+</span><span>面试成绩</span><span>(</span><span>百分制</span><span>)× 60%</span></p><p><span>         3. </span><span>考核时间、地点</span></p><p><span>面试时间</span><span><span>:</span><span><span></span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>日</span><span>9</span><span>：</span><span>30-12</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>面试地点</span><span>:</span><span>东校区精化中心</span><span>D</span><span>栋</span><span>215</span><span>会议室。</span></p><p><span>  <span>  4. </span></span><span>考核程序：每位考生的面试时间为</span><span>10</span><span>分钟。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span>学生自述</span></span></span></p><p><span>   介绍在本科期间学习情况、参加科技、体育等活动的获奖情况</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span>专业课程基础知识考查：专家组提问，考生回答</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span>专家测评：由考核专家随机提问</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>五、监督机制</span></strong></p><p><span>实行公示制度。对接收计划、遴选基本程序和规定、拟接收学生名单等全部实行公示。</span></p><p><span><span><span>绿色农药全国重点实验室</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（精细化工研究开发中心）</span></span></p><p><span></span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div></div>","textSha256":"e1b61c8b65a60a674721a163a4dc2593a2331ad9008ba53fce2c0f5343f29953","textLength":1283,"sourceSha256":"a12b2cbc88e6bf96b58f0115f1fcf8e3577e6f720de30a71ae903fd57fa83649","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e3827dc050042785ec2f","title":"2026年贵州大学绿色农药全国重点实验室（精细化工研究开发中心）接收2027届优秀应届本科毕业生复试细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:57.797501+00:00"}
